Z||000000||JetroGT||10-22-2000||01:25 AM||||I drove out to a little town south of Dallas to take a look at an 86GT they had for sale. The car is exactly like the GT I used to own. It's got the sunroof, power everything and the performance sound. Great red paint. The rear cover was repainted, and why they painted the molding is beyond me, but the rest looks great! <BR>I need to talk the guy down though. It's priced at 4995 or something. I didn't really get a very good look at it today because it was dark and rainy. But it's exactly what I've been looking for. ||||reg||6
Z||000001||2xsess||10-22-2000||02:11 PM||||OUCH <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">, $4995 is way high unless it was very low miles. Other than that it sounds like a good find.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>85GT||||reg||1
